pub static LEVEL_NAMES: [&str; 16] = ["Crater Fields", "Crystal Caves", "Mildred's Citadel", "Meteor Mesa", "Zarg Lookout", "Marshmallow Meadows", "Bonbon Playhouse", "Fudge Bog", "Mirror Shafts", "Sugar Glass Gallery", "Frosting Flats", "Frosting Spire", "Cocoa Foundry", "Gumdrop Isle", "Whisper Hollow", "The Saucer"];
pub static LEVEL_BLURBS: [&str; 16] = ["Twinkling crystal craters and chocolate pools.", "Dark, glittering tunnels over chocolate rivers.", "A castle of cake, cookie doors and frozen chocolate.", "Biscuit-rock mesas in open sky, with cloud ledges between them.", "A watchtower of ladders, stairs and one slow lift. The red key is on the roof.", "Soft hills, fenced-in marshmallows to bounce off, and a blue key in the clouds.", "A candy theatre. The walls are only painted flats, so walk right in.", "Wide pools of hot fudge, stepping stones and three very puffy spore pods.", "A tall crystal shaft sealed by gates. Bounce fizz off the mirrors to reach the switches.", "A long gallery of hidden rooms. Not everything on these walls is decoration.", "Long, open stretches of frosted rock, spike runs and hover platforms. Mind the drones.", "The tallest Zarg tower: twelve floors, three lifts, and a key in every colour.", "Belts, presses and pools of molten metal. Mind the timing, and mind the belts.", "A secret island, covered in snacks. Nobody was supposed to find this place.", "A cave for climbers: a vine rope over fudge, a chimney to kick up, and hanging vines.", "Ben’s own flying saucer, parked and steaming. Nothing to clear; just a look around."];
pub static LEVEL_CLEARED: [&str; 16] = ["The path on to Meteor Mesa is open. Clear it and Zarg Lookout, and the first teleporter will hum.", "One of the two levels the Frosting Frontier teleporter wants is done. Mirror Shafts is the other.", "The Citadel is cleared.", "The sky is clear all the way to the horizon. Zarg Lookout is next along the path.", "The first teleporter is humming now, and Marshmallow Meadows are waiting.", "Marshmallow fluff clings to Ben’s boots. Somewhere ahead, the music of a playhouse.", "The curtain falls on a very sticky stage. That is one of the two levels the teleporter to Rock Candy Reach wants; Marshmallow Meadows is the other.", "Ben wipes fudge off his boots. That was the hard way round, and he knows it.", "The last gate slides open and the shaft hums. That is one of the two levels the teleporter to the Frosting Frontier wants; the Crystal Caves are the other.", "Ben leaves the gallery with a head full of paintings and pockets full of crumbs.", "A long way across, and not a single frosting stain on Ben’s helmet. Almost.", "Twelve floors up and twelve floors down, and Ben’s knees have opinions about it. The Citadel needs both the Spire and the Foundry.", "The presses thump on without him. Ben dusts the soot off his helmet. The Citadel needs both the Spire and the Foundry.", "Ben leaves the island with a few more lives than he came with, and a very full pocket.", "Ben’s arms ache and his boots are scuffed. The old paintings never mentioned the climb, but somebody grew those vines on purpose.", ""];
pub static SIGNS: [&str; 3] = ["Welcome to Crater Corners. Population: nine, plus one very confident cat. Please wipe your boots.", "The Sticky Bun Bakery: closed since the Zargs borrowed the cocoa. Sorry, no refunds.", "The fountain used to run chocolate. Now it runs on hope and a leaky pipe."];
