pub static TOASTS: [&str; 25] = ["The red cookie door swings open", "The blue cookie door swings open", "The green cookie door swings open", "Extra life! Every 100 snack points earns one.", "Gold USB drive! Find the security terminal.", "Somewhere ahead, a bridge rumbles into place", "The bridge folds away", "A crystal chimes, and the gate above slides open", "A painted wall: tiny figures tend rows of glowing crystals, and a sun with two faces looks down", "A painted wall: a round ship lands, and the little figures wave with four arms each", "A painted wall: a figure pours something fizzy on a dry crack, and a green sprout bursts out", "A painted wall: a long stair winds down into the dark, and every step has a small candle", "The hatch is propped open with a stack of comic books. The saucer hums to itself, waiting for a full crew", "The galley: a pot of spaghetti and meatballs is still simmering. The engine runs on it, and nobody asks how", "Two bunks. One is Ben's. The other has a football helmet on the pillow, and nobody has touched it", "A star chart with Zargoth circled twice in red marker, and \"COCOA?!\" written beside it", "A shelf of souvenirs: a very old gumdrop, a jar of crater dust, and a rubber duck in a tiny helmet", "The bridge. The captain's chair is a bean bag, and the steering wheel came off a go-kart", "Thirty bounces. Ben is not a kangaroo, but he is doing a very good impression", "Ben has been told that marshmallows are not trampolines. He disagrees", "Ben's knees file a formal complaint about all this wall-kicking", "Ben whistles a little tune. The level waits politely", "A chalk drawing of Billy in his helmet. \"FIND ME\", it says, with an arrow pointing at nothing", "A chalk drawing of Mortimer McMire. Someone has added a moustache. \"WANTED: FOR STEALING COCOA\"", "A mural of the crystal forest — a ring of trees glows in the far north-east"];
